---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Alpha CCTV Solution"
  description="Privacy policy for the Alpha CCTV Solution website."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>
          A simple explanation of how information submitted through this
          website is handled.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section container privacy-copy">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> October 2026</p>

      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>
        This website may ask for your name, phone number, area and service
        enquiry. The current website is static and does not store form
        submissions on a website server. When configured, submitting the
        form opens WhatsApp with a pre-filled message; you choose whether
        to send it.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose to continue in WhatsApp, your message is handled by
        WhatsApp under its own privacy terms. Google Fonts may also be
        requested by your browser to display website typography.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For questions about this policy, contact the business using the
        contact details supplied by the business owner.
      </p>

      <div class="product-note">
        Before publishing, the business owner should review this policy
        and update it to match actual data handling practices.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>